{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>黃又南昨日（11月2日）迎來43歲生日，回顧過去一年幕前幕後多項突破，包括作品上映、考獲電車車長牌照及落場參與賽車。事業迎來新進展之際，單身近5年之後，他在生日帖末段公開另一個令人意外的願望。</p>\n<h2>黃又南生日帖回顧一年突破</h2>\n<p>黃又南在社交平台發表長文，逐一細數過去一年的經歷，除了分享影視工作獲得正面迴響，亦提到自己成功取得電車車長牌照，並以賽車手身分參加多場賽事。從幕前演出走到駕駛席及賽道，他形容當中有勝有負，希望趁仍有體力時，多做真正喜歡的事情。</p>\n<h2>黃又南親述賽車承諾安全為先</h2>\n<p>面對家人及公司對賽車安全的關注，黃又南在帖文中主動報平安，表示已答應大家參賽時會格外小心，亦以「平安大吉」安撫身邊人。他從多次跨界嘗試中得到「事在人為」的體會，並鼓勵大家不要輕易被生活困境擊倒，字裏行間流露出繼續挑戰新事物的決心。</p>\n<h2>《再見UFO》上映為事業添喜訊</h2>\n<p>演藝工作方面，拍攝多年的電影《再見UFO》終於順利上映兼獲得多個獎項，黃又南雖然未有得獎，但獲提名肯定已感到滿足。他參演的《我們不是什麼》及《存酒人》亦得到正面迴響。至於感情生活，他透露自己已單身近5年，43歲生日除了期望挑戰更多角色，亦首次明言會「認真考慮拍拍拖」。</p>\n<h2>網民聚焦單身五年生日願望</h2>\n<p>黃又南公開一年成績與人生感悟後，獲得不少粉絲送上生日祝福，其電車車長牌照、賽車手經歷及感情願望亦成為焦點。相比幕前作品帶來的肯定，他在單身近5年後主動表示考慮戀愛，令這篇原本以事業回顧為主的帖文突然出現反差，粉絲亦關注他來年會否迎來感情新進展。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369488959939159_9145344956ae99ca9df46f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"wongyounam_1793599629_4021327049240328495_366892595.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369488959939159_9145344956ae99ca9df46f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369489080281089_21446700906ae99cab079eb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"wongyounam_1793599629_4021327012733083958_366892595.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369489080281089_21446700906ae99cab079eb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369489189014746_15181963786ae99cac1f909.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"wongyounam_1793599629_4021327013638954202_366892595.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369489189014746_15181963786ae99cac1f909.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369489336226298_14145516646ae99cadbad41.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"wongyounam_1793599629_4021327022698788791_366892595.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369489336226298_14145516646ae99cadbad41.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/zx7rxneptns5l7evqopgmns1kvlavclywoie8mkinva_1645029500690c17548e3bb-1024x1024.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃又南 shine 又南早前完成人生第一場賽車。（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/zx7rxneptns5l7evqopgmns1kvlavclywoie8mkinva_1645029500690c17548e3bb-1024x1024.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>又南早前完成人生第一場賽車。（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/17794421826811730_1880275866a102206d84e3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"703414746_17964552255118109_2631568202876082279_n.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/17794421826811730_1880275866a102206d84e3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176537840077420099_973667596693989613d4f6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃又南 駕駛牌照 早前獲得巴士牌（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176537840077420099_973667596693989613d4f6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>早前獲得巴士牌（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176537840286889804_2406628456939896325e64.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃又南 駕駛牌照 又有的士排（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176537840286889804_2406628456939896325e64.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>又有的士排（圖片來源：IG@wongyounam）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:02:47.848814+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1025,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:34:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:19:02.955326+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:59:02.636580+00:00","content_hash":"d8241b74191586557b3af1271be2a2d5a41c3d5ef7de19a3f2a314e9be63cf82","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}